A <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/naming-authority/qld-pn-act-1994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Naming of a place, described as an area or geographical feature (whether natural or artificial) other than an excluded place. Excluded places are a road within the meaning of the Transport Operations (Road Use Management) Act 1995, a canal associated with a residential or commercial development, a building or similar structure, a dam wall or similar structure, a division or ward of a local government area, a place given a name under another law of the State or the Commonwealth such as a port, electoral district or local government areas, or any other place described by a regulation. For a place name to be entered into the Gazetteer of Place Names, the name must have been designated in accordance with the procedure prescribed in the Place Names Act 1994. Applies in Queensland."@en <urn:qali:graph:vocabs> .
